1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,630
Brief udah jelas.

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:03,740
Tapi kanvas gue masih kosong.

3
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,550
Dan sekarang...

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,930
Pinterest gue udah kayak
gudang referensi.

5
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,860
Awalnya gue cuma mau
cari satu inspirasi.

6
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,300
Eh, nemu yang bagus.

7
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,190
Scroll lagi,

8
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,160
ada yang lebih keren.

9
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,120
Simpan lagi,

10
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,140
scroll lagi...

11
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:16,560
Lah,

12
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:17,640
udah setengah jam?!

13
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,010
Referensinya banyak.

14
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,770
Tapi mulai desainnya
dari mana?

15
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,270
Layout ini bagus.

16
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,300
Font itu keren.

17
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,470
Yang tadi juga menarik!

18
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,100
Duh...

19
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,680
malah makin bingung.

20
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,400
Oke,

21
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,100
stop dulu.

22
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,510
Gue tutup Pinterest,

23
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:30,700
terus balik ke brief.

24
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,980
Tiga kata kunci:

25
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:32,760
muda,

26
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:33,470
tegas,

27
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:33,960
hemat.

28
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,390
Gue pilih tiga referensi
yang paling sesuai,

29
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,160
lalu bikin tiga sketsa kasar.

30
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,580
Nggak semuanya bagus.

31
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:41,660
Tapi sekarang gue tahu
mana yang paling cocok.

32
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,340
Nah, tinggal pilih warna!

33
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:43,920
Eh,

34
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,820
hijau sama kuning cocok.

35
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,350
Tapi kok desain gue malah
kayak spanduk diskon?!

36
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:51,180
Waduh, episode tiga
bakal ribet nih.
